+# Production hardening final checklist
+
+This document ties together operational steps and artifacts added by the repo to close production gaps.
+
+1. vLLM & GPU nodes
+ - Use ops/infra/create_gpu_nodepool.sh to provision GPU nodepool for your cloud.
+ - Deploy helm/aegis-vllm with production values; run ops/ci/load_test_async.py and ops/ci/backpressure_probe.py to tune BATCH_MAX_SIZE and TIMEOUT.
+
+2. Backpressure & async server testing
+ - Execute load tests from staging and collect p95/p99 latencies; tune batching and concurrency accordingly.
+
+3. KMS/Cosign & audit
+ - Follow ops/security/kms_orchestration.md and produce audit bundle via ops/security/kms_audit_collect.sh; schedule crypto audit.
+
+4. Postgres HA & backup
+ - Deploy HA Postgres (Patroni or managed). Configure ops/db/pg_backup_cronjob.yaml and validate restore.
+
+5. Vectorstore persistence
+ - Deploy Chroma via helm/chroma chart; enable backups to S3 and test restore per ops/backup/restore_chroma_example.md.
+
+6. Feast / Data infra
+ - Productionize Feast per ops/feature/feast_prod_readme.md and monitor feature materialization.
+
+7. Lineage & catalog
+ - Deploy Marquez/OpenLineage and wire OPENLINEAGE_URL; use ops/lineage/openlineage_client.py in ETL and train pipelines.
+
+8. Canary & retrain automation
+ - Use ops/cicd/canary_promote.py for automated safe promotion with smoke tests & Prometheus checks.
+ - Use ops/retrain/retrain_trigger.py to trigger Argo retrain workflows on drift signals.
+
+9. Formal checks
+ - Run ops/formal/run_formal_checks.sh regularly in CI and provide outputs to auditors.
+
